  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With VRChat expanding to more platforms such as mobile devices, this feature is needed more than ever. Worlds that rely on VR interactions may not work well on mobile devices or vice versa. By allowing creators to set world access by device, they can optimize their worlds for their target audience and avoid frustration and disappointment from players who cannot enjoy their worlds properly.\n\nWe have workarounds like the \"IsUserInVR\" check but this can create a lot of friction when a player is isolated from the rest of the world when they join. Having a simple way to disallow certain devices will help relieve this friction.\n\nAttached is a quick mock-up of what the UI could look like for this feature.",
